window.products.push({"id":336075,"name":"Desperate Enterprises Nerd Garage Tin Sign - Nostalgic Vintage Metal Wall Decor - Made in USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uuaLuHdvL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"DIMENSIONS: 12.5\"W x 16\"H EASY TO HANG ART: This Lightweight Metal Tin Sign Comes With Pre-Drilled Holes To Make Displaying A Breeze. The Edges Of Each Tin Sign Are Rolled And Hemmed For Safe Handling. CLASSIC VINTAGE DECOR: These Retro Collectible Tin Signs Are A Fun And Attractive Decoration For Your Home, Office, Bar, Restaurant, Dorm, Man Cave Or Garage! MADE IN AMERICA: Proudly Manufactured In The U.S.A. ABOUT DESPERATE ENTERPRISES: Located In Northeast Ohio, We Have Been In Business Since 1987. Our American-Made Products Are Licensed And We Stand Behind The Quality With A 100% Satisfaction Guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uuaLuHdvL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Desperate Enterprises","source_asin":"B0B7KC7B7J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336075","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7KC7B7J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7KC7B7J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":336076,"name":"Ragproper Modern Glass Hip Flask - Glass Flask Bottle with Caps for Liquor & Spirits, Durable Liquor Glass Flask with Cork Lids, Pour Funnel, Black Si","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+5ZRDaLhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STYLISH & FUNCTIONAL DESIGN: Add a touch of class to your drinking experience with the Ragproper Glass Liquor Flask. This 240ml glass bottle comes with a black silicone sleeve for a superior grip and feel. The soft-touch silicone cover is removable, versatile, and washable. Use the glass flask to carry rum, whisky, gin, vodka, tequila, scotch, or any spirit of your choice.​ LIDS AND FUNNEL INCLUDED: Our Glass Liquor Flask bottles are designed to be metal-free and highly durable. Each break-resistant glass flask comes with 1 gunmetal lid and 1 plastic cork lined lid, plus 2 extra silicone lid liners to prevent leaks. It also includes 1 custom-designed smooth pour funnel that helps prevent bubbles in your favorite drink. POCKET-FRIENDLY, LEAKPROOF FLASK: The Ragproper Glass Liquor Flask is a compact and handy glass flask that will snuggly fit in your hand. Easy to carry, you can now take your precious liquor anywhere without worrying about spilling or leakage. The easy pour window feature in the sleeve helps monitor how much liquid is in the flask! VERSATILE LIQUOR GLASS FLASK: This sleek and sturdy glass liquor flask is the ideal accessory for any occasion. Whether you're bringing it on a hiking trip, camping, fishing, or at concerts, the Ragproper Glass Liquor Flask with silicone sleeve suits many activities and uses. It is made from break-resistant glass and will likely survive minor drops and spills. ABOUT RAGPROPER: The word Ragproper was formally used in old western slang, which means 'dress well,' and may also be known as ‘gentleman.’ After a terrible experience drinking a forgotten whiskey from a metal flask– we searched the internet for a glass flask and could only find relics from the golden age of flasks. Hence, we began our quest to design the modern glass flask and bring quality drinkware to those who love their precious spirits.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+5ZRDaLhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ragproper","source_asin":"B0BL1SW21T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336076","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL1SW21T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL1SW21T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":336077,"name":"Flower of Life Copper Offering Bowl - Solid Copper Bowl for Ritual Use, Altar Table, Incense Holder, Home Decor - Sacred Geometric Pattern for Positiv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MsrzL3mCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This stunning decorative copper bowl is the perfect addition to your altar supplies, spiritual room decor, and more. Place upon an altar cloth and make meaningful offerings to your ancestors or deities with water, salt, herbs, crystals, or other valuable items. A fundamental form in sacred geometry, the Flower of Life represents creation and the connectedness of all living things. As you present your offering, meditate on how we are all one with nature. Use as a smudge bowl for your sage smudge sticks or palo santo sticks. Fill with decorative sand to snuff out smudge sticks or to hold incense sticks as they burn. Copper makes a great incense burner holder! Each small decorative bowl is handcrafted from a sheet of solid copper and embellished with sacred symbols. The convenient size is perfect for hand-held applications or holding small trinkets. Approximate dimensions: 3\" wide and 1.75\" tall. A thoughtful gift for anyone interested in wiccan supplies, pagan decor, or witchcraft. Combine with other items, such as chime candles, herbs, healing crystals, or incense to create a complete gift set.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MsrzL3mCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alternative Imagination","source_asin":"B09QT5BZMV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336077","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QT5BZMV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QT5BZMV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":336078,"name":"Vangao Nursery Blackout Curtains Kids Room Darkening for Bedroom 63 inches Long Twinkle Star Star Cutout Draperies Grommet Top Thermal Insulated Windo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j1q-NwWYS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【PACKING DETAIL】 Each package includes 2 blackout curtain panels, 1 panel measures 52 inch wide X 63 inch long, each panel has 8 matte metal grommets. 【INNOVATIVE DESIGN】 This blackout curtain is made of triple weave fabric, nice quality of matte metal grommets and elegant hemming, 1.6 inch inner diameter top grommets ring fits all standard curtain rods. 【ELEGANT LOOK】The 1.18 inch bottom hem compared to ordinary curtains(0.39\") makes it classy and ELEGANT, they are soft and silky fabric, same material back as of front, 8 matte silver metal grommets, 2.4\" external diameter and inner is 1.6\" 【ENERGY SAVING】 Soft and silky blackout curtain drape can balance your room temperature, insulate heat in summer and cold in winter, which makes energy saving and energy efficient, also protect your furniture and your electric appliance from sun light. 【EASY CARE】 Machine washable, wrinkles free, even a little left will be disappeared after hanging for a few weeks, or warm iron","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j1q-NwWYS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vangao","source_asin":"B07H2ZBJW1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336078","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H2ZBJW1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H2ZBJW1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":336079,"name":"ALASKA EAGLE ULU","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YnYPxJUML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The versatile and functional ulu (pronounced 'oo-loo') has been perfected over the last five millennia by the Native peoples of Alaska and the Arctic. The curved shape of the ulu is inspired by the original material it was made from- slate, a stone whose naturally occurring flakes often have a sharp, curved edge. The ulu is an all-purpose knife; grasp the easy-grip handle and use a rocking motion to chop, dice or slice just about anything in your kitchen. Especially good for chopping herbs, and dicing onions and garlic. The design of the ulu, with the handle above the blade (as opposed to the handle being at the end of the blade, as with most knives) centers your cutting force over the blade, which makes cutting both easier and more efficient. The ergonomic design makes it useful for those with arthritis, carpal tunnel, tendonitis, and other degenerative disorders. (In fact, Ulu Factory ulus are endorsed by the American Arthritis Foundation.) The ulu can even be used by hunters, to skin and dress game, and in fishing, to clean and fillet fish. Use your ulu with an ulu-specific chopping bowl, or any regular cutting board. Ulus make excellent conversation pieces. Comes with directions, history, and stand. Made in Alaska with U.S. Stainless Steel and birch handle with carved eagle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YnYPxJUML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The ULU Factory","source_asin":"B007ED0YRU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336079","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007ED0YRU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007ED0YRU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
