window.products.push({"id":336350,"name":"Rowenta TO-912 4-Slice Toaster, Pearl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EKPTJ2WML._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Essentially this is like two toasters united into one sleek appliance. Each two slice side can function independently of the other. Quartz and mica heating elements ensure the most even and quickest browning possible, and after all that's what you are buying a toaster for, right? In addition bagels can be toasted on the cut side, while gently warmed on the exterior, thanks to the special Bagel Function. As if that weren't enough, the integrated warming platform will warm, or reheat, pastries, buns, rolls and more. Oh, and this is one fine looking 21st century toaster too! Amazon.com Ready to take on everything from white bread to bagels to hamburger buns, this toaster's extra-large slots (1-3/8 inches wide, 5 inches long, and 5-1/2 inches deep) can fit whatever you need toasted. Similar in appearance to the bottom of an iron (a product Rowenta is known well for), the toaster's top is actually a unique warming tray. You can place pastries, croissants, or rolls on the top of the toaster and the tray quickly and evenly warms them without drying them out. This four-slice toaster has separate controls for each pair of slots so it's like having two toasters contained in one unit. This versatile feature lets you toast different breads at different ranges of browning at the same time. Special settings for each side include a bagel function, which toasts only the cut side of the bagel while warming it throughout, and a defrost function, which adjusts the toasting time to accommodate frozen breads or waffles. A seven-position control on each side lets you choose the degree of browning you prefer on your toasted goods. In addition, a Stop button allows you to finish toasting on either side and eject your bread at any time. The toaster's lift is extra high, so it's easy to remove smaller pieces of bread without burning your fingers. The plastic sides of this toaster stay cool to the touch while the appliance is operating and wipe down for easy cleaning. Inconspicuous crumb trays below each of the browning controls are removable for easy cleaning of the toaster's interior. The nonstick, stain-resistant warming tray is also removable for cleaning and is dishwasher safe. This toaster is covered by a one-year warranty. --Cristina Vaamonde","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EKPTJ2WML._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rowenta","source_asin":"B00006JL0V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336350","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00006JL0V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00006JL0V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
