window.products.push({"id":336364,"name":"Pfaltzgraff Everyday Linden 45-Piece Service for 8","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LgWCpImmL._AC_.jpg","description":"Pfaltgraff Everyday Linden 45-piece Service for 8-Set Includes 8 Each: Salad Forks, Dinner Forks, Dinner Spoons, teaspoonns, plus 1 Each Tablespoon, Pierced Tablespoon, Cold Meat Fork, Butter Serving Knife and Sugar Spoon. Stainless steel is completely dishwasher-safe and easy to maintain. Follow these few simple hints to ensure that your fine stainless steel flatware lasts for many years: Wash flatware prior to using for the first time. Avoid soaking stainless flatware in water for a prolonged period of time or overnight Before placing in washer, rinse food from flatware When loading your dishwasher, make sure knife blades do not come into contact with other utensils. This will prevent blades from nicking or scratching other pieces. Use a mild non-chloride detergent. Never pour detergent directly onto flatware. In hard water areas, use a water-softening agent to avoid spotting or pitting. Always remove stainless flatware from the dishwasher shortly after the drying cycle is complete. This decreases the amount of time your flatware is exposed to a very moist and hot environment and allows it to dry in cool drier air. Should detergent film build up on your flatware, wash (either by hand or in a dishwasher) and hand-dry to remove film. If stubborn stains or rust should occur, use a non-abrasive stainless or metal polish paste or cream. Avoid grainy cleaners. Limit exposure to water that has a high mineral content, high chloride dishwashing detergent and foods that contain chloride (table salt, mustard, mayonnaise and eggs) as pitting or spotting may occur.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LgWCpImmL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pfaltzgraff","source_asin":"B00200LIEA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336364","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00200LIEA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00200LIEA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":336365,"name":"Stainless Steel Moka Pot Stovetop Espresso percolator coffee pots electric italian turkish portable camping moka pots 12 cup 6 cup 9 cup 3 cup coffee ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614qc5eR4JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What is the advantage of this stovetop espresso maker? Safety valve, the role of the safety valve, when the internal pressure of the moka pot is too high, or the resistance of the coffee powder is too large, release excess pressure to ensure the taste and safety of coffee Safety valve, the role of the safety valve, when the internal pressure of the moka pot is too high, or the resistance of the coffee powder is too large, release excess pressure to ensure the taste and safety of coffee Option:  2 Cup(100ml),  4 Cup(200ml),  6 Cup(300ml),9 Cup(450ml),  12 Cup(600ml), Option:  2 Cup(100ml),  4 Cup(200ml),  6 Cup(300ml),9 Cup(450ml),  12 Cup(600ml), Suitable for: Fire and induction cookers, electric furnace, ceramic furnace, alcohol furnace, gas stove. Suitable for: Fire and induction cookers, electric furnace, ceramic furnace, alcohol furnace, gas stove. Bonus: 100 pieces of coffee filter paper are given away for free, sincerely wish you can start with a cup of fragrant latte every day Bonus: 100 pieces of coffee filter paper are given away for free, sincerely wish you can start with a cup of fragrant latte every day How to use: Step 1 To start, unscrew the top part of the espresso maker with the handle from the bottom part of the espresso maker and remove the funnel that nests inside the base of the espresso maker. Step 2 Next, fill base with water (DO NOT exceed the safety valve. )Replace the funnel into the base and fill it with ground coffee; do not press coffee down. For best results, use fresh roasted, finely ground coffee. The recommendation is to use a 6-to-1 water to coffee ratio. For each tablespoon of coffee, use 3 oz. of water. Step 3 Tighten the top to the base. Make sure the top is completely screwed on to the base before putting on the stovetop. Step 4 Heat espresso maker on low to medium temperature until coffee bubbles on top. Remove from heat and serve.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614qc5eR4JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nobranded","source_asin":"B0895WDKYT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336365","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0895WDKYT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0895WDKYT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
