window.products.push({"id":336472,"name":"DOEARTE 41st Birthday Gifts for Men - Vintage 1982 Tumbler Cup - 41st Birthday Decorations - 40 Year Old Birthday Idea Gifts for Man, Dad, Brother, Be","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71naiE8A0CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT FIT AS 41ST BIRTHDAY GIFTS for MEN - Help celebrate the 41 year olds birthday with this timeless and durable stainless steel tumbler. The insulated tumbler can be used for many years in daily life. Love will last forever just like the wine tumbler. FUN NOVELTY GIFT FOR 41-YEAR-OLD MAN - This tumbler can not only be used as 41st birthday gifts but also 41st anniversary, 41st class reunion, retirement even Christmas gifts. In a word choose this tumbler you can use it as a gift for any occasion. PREMIUM MATERIAL AND BPA FREE - These tumblers also come with a convenient reusable drink straw, straw cleaning brush, and BPA-free drink lid. Crafted with 18/8 food grade stainless steel these tumblers are durable, unbreakable, sweat proof, rust resistant and perfect for backyard barbecues, hanging out at the pool, or enjoying a hot day at the beach with friends. USED INDOOR AND OUTDOOR - Our Tumbler is suitable for any indoor or outdoor places. Perfect for enjoying drinks at home, on the beach, by the lake, at the pool, in the office, at the party, during RV tours, cabin trips, camping, hiking, picnic, BBQ. The tumbler can help maintain your drink’s temperature for a long time, which makes the ideal companion for alcoholic and non-alcoholic drinks, wine, cocktails, mixed drinks, champagne, juice, hot or ice coffee, water, tea, etc. DOUBLE WALL VACUUM INSULATED – Hand wash recommended. Made only from the highest quality premium 304 18/8 food grade stainless steel, highly resistant to rust and break, and easy to clean by hand. The design of walled exterior with a vacuum sealed area between the walls, which can help maintain your drinks temperature for a long time and protects your hands against the temperature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71naiE8A0CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOEARTE","source_asin":"B0B9FM9QQW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336472","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9FM9QQW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9FM9QQW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":336473,"name":"West of the Wind All-Weather Art Print, 30 by 40-Inch, Restorante Assisi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QOLhoKhwL._AC_SL1039_.jpg","description":"Create your own oasis with our stunning images of places near and far. By the pool, an outdoor kitchen, balcony, porch or patio, West of the Wind's Giclee' on Canvas adds a new design dimension to these areas. The amazing clarity of our images in this large format starts with licensing the finest professional photographers whose work can be enlarged while still retaining the crispness and detail of the original photo. Using the Giclee' method of technology and state of the art equipment, we are able to reproduce these artists' works for use in a variety of outdoor applications. Giclee' is the French word meaning \"to spray or squirt with a nozzle\". The term \"Giclee' print\" connotes an elevation in printmaking technology. Images are generated from high resolution digital scans and printed with archival quality inks onto canvas. The Giclee' printing process provides better color accuracy than other means of production. Each print is secured to the frame using the gallery wrap method so the image on the sides is a continuation of the main image. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting. Our outdoor art framework consists of vinyl stretcher bars that are impervious to moisture, cold and heat. Additionally, non-corrosive stainless steel staples are used to attach the stretched canvas to the bars. Your print can be installed with our simple hardware that is designed to withstand 60 mph winds. The Outdoor Canvas Art is waterproof, UV protected so it can be placed in any outdoor location with direct exposure to the elements. Measures 30 x 1.5 x 40 inches. An artists drawing of an Italian ristorante on this colorful print.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QOLhoKhwL._AC_SL1039_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"West Wind","source_asin":"B006M5WPAU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336473","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006M5WPAU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006M5WPAU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
