window.products.push({"id":336558,"name":"Potato Masher, Ricer Potato Smasher, Grid Food Mill Hand Nylon Kitchen Potato Press Food Masher","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y29vrMMWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why we need a Potato Masher: Smash is an essential cooking echnique which can retain the food's freshness and quality intact, and after which we can enjoy a delicious dish of creamy mashed potatoes, or making healthy homemade baby food for our babies.  However it is thought to be very time consuming and pain-inducing, particularly for those suffering from arthritis or hand injuries.  Luckily, we develop our mahser after research and experimentation, and come up with a new kitchen tool! Our advantages: 1. masher allows you to mash food to a perfect and neat texture, making it easy to cook and digest. 2. fine nylon grid plate helps you mash food quicker, applying little pressure, while preventing potatoes and food from slipping off your plate. 3. small and compact, our masher takes up minimal space, and can be stored inside your kitchen drawers, or hanged from your kitchen utensils countertop rack. Tips for making baby food: 1. Choose yellow vegetables such as sweet potatoes, pumpkin, baby can accept more easily, and they have higher nutritional value.  2. Vegetables which contain a lot of oxalates, such as spinach, is not so suitable for small babies. 3. Apples, pears, incense and avocados can also be made into fruit puree.  4. Four best choice vegetables for baby food: pumpkins, lettuces, tomatoes and carrots.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y29vrMMWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VENDERIES","source_asin":"B073P98JCF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336558","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073P98JCF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073P98JCF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
