window.products.push({"id":336634,"name":"12 Pieces Burlap Wine Bags Jute Wine Bottle Bags with Drawstrings Reusable Wine Gift Bags with Tags for Christmas Holiday Party Birthday Wedding Trave","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81H4+qTlMdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features: Nice combination: 1 Package consists of 12 burlap wine bags and 12 pieces of rectangular heart gift tags, with a 10-meter-long drawstring, this combination can meet your wine wrapping needs at one stop.  Widely usage: The burlap wine bags can help you pack wine bottles and champagne bottles, it can also be a good choice as gift bag for visiting, guesting, parties, wedding ceremony, holiday celebration and family reunion.  Specification: Wine bag material: cotton and linen type fabric Gift tags material: craft paper Wine bag size: 13.8 x 6 inch/ 35 x 15 cm Gift tags size: 3.74 x 1.77 inch/ 9.5 x 4.5 cm Jute rope length: 10 meters Color: as shown in the picture  Package includes: 12 x Burlap wine bags 12 x Gift tags 1 x Jute rope  Note: Manually measure, please allow slight size errors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81H4+qTlMdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boao","source_asin":"B07Y4PXG8C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336634","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y4PXG8C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y4PXG8C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":336635,"name":"Pampas Grass Decor with Vase | Home Decor Boho Style Weddings and Gift | Bunny Tails Wheat and Natural Dried Pampas Arrangement 100 Pcs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pGv1lOz4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"New Pampas Décor - Your new 100 Pcs pampas grass bundle includes; 10 pcs brown pampas, 10 pcs white wheat, 20 pcs brown bunny tails, 20 pcs white bunny tails, and 40 pcs white pampa grass). Four beautiful neutral tones, Ivory, beige, white, and soft brown. The pampas arrangement is 21 inches tall with the vase. The stems' total size is 17 inches. Your pampas branches will arrive ready to display in a 7-inch tall ceramic vase included. Ready-to-Gift - Our 100 pieces of naturally dried plants are perfect for any occasion! These assorted plants are easy to care for and blend with natural or fresh flowers to create a beautiful dried floral bouquet. Pampas grass is an excellent selection for making beautiful gifts for your loved ones. Boho Home Décor - The perfect way to bring nature home and give your space a natural, elegant look. These dried plants have a spectacular fluffy texture, making them ideal for use in your bedroom, dining room, kitchen, home office, or living room. Pampa's grass's small branches are also perfect for home decor as bouquet fillers. Place them on the coffee table, bathroom vanity, or office desk. These earthy colors will match any décor style. Rustic Wedding Décor- Pampas grass is a unique and beautiful addition to any event, whether a rustic country wedding or an elegant formal look. The delicate grass plumes add a natural beauty unmatched by other plants or flowers. Pampas grass can be used in various ways to enhance your event’s overall look and feel. Small pieces of pampas grass can be used for beach weddings to create floral arrangements and decorate tables. DIY Projects - The pampas grass bundle creates beautiful arrangements that add boho style to any setting. Decorate your rustic farmhouse party table decor, baby shower, romantic and vintage rustic house, or country-style decoration. Whether you’re looking to mix different plants and flowers or create a decorative arrangement with our fluffy pampas grass, we have the beautiful arrangement to achieve the perfect look. Natural Look - This beautiful boho pampas grass will provide a modern farmhouse look or a blissful coastal decor to your space. Short pampas grass branches can bring a minimalist touch to any house decor without compromising a rustic natural style. This decorative grass is prevalent for decorating special events and natural home decorations. Natural dry pampas grass can showcase the true beauty of nature and reveal a rich, fluffy texture.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pGv1lOz4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bella Dian","source_asin":"B0BL6MXG36","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336635","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL6MXG36","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL6MXG36","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":336636,"name":"Glass Foam Soap Dispenser - Refillable Foaming Hand Soap Dispenser Clear Pump Bottle for Bathroom (Large Clear)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MAR2tAcmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"「GLASS SOAP DISPENSER」 This foaming soap dispenser is mainly made of high-quality transparent glass, which is crystal clear, not easy to age, safe and healthy. On the appearance, the cup body is full of sunflower relief patterns, simple and beautiful. It is a practical and beautiful soap dispenser, which is very suitable for placing on your bathroom counter. 「SIZE AND SPECIFICATION」The large soap dispenser is 6.1 inches high, 3.15 inches in diameter, and 13.52 ounces in capacity. The small soap dispenser is 5.03 inches high, 3.15 inches in diameter, and 10.14 ounces in capacity. 「ABS PUMP HEDA」 The press head is chrome plated ABS pump head, which can be pressed in a large area with ease, time and effort saving, and is very user-friendly. Mousse delicate foam inner core, the pressed foam is very rich, soft and delicate (20% soap lotion and 80% water need to be added to the bottle). The super large bottle mouth design allows you to pour soap into the sub bottles without waste due to leakage. 「MULTI FUNCTION USE」The reusable soap dispenser can be used for detergent, make-up water, essential oil, shampoo, detergent, shower gel and massage oil. The pump head can also be disassembled and used as a mouthwash cup. It will be the best choice to match the decoration of your bathroom or kitchen sink. 「QUALITY ASSURANCE」 If you are not completely satisfied, after receiving your detachable soap dispenser doesn't perform as expected, please contact us immediately. we offer a no hassle, no questions asked money back guarantee. 「Tip」To ensure proper functioning of the foam pump, make sure to remove any air trapped inside the bottle before use. Here's how to do it: Press down the foam pump head while holding the bottle upside down. Keep the pump head pressed for a few seconds until foam or liquid comes out. Release the pump head and it should return to its original position. This process will remove any air pockets that may have accumulated in the bottle, allowing the foam pump to work effectively. Remember to repeat this step if you notice the foam pump losing suction or becoming difficult to use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MAR2tAcmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEICURACE","source_asin":"B0BLS3Q4BK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336636","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLS3Q4BK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLS3Q4BK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
