window.products.push({"id":336707,"name":"BestNest Nature Press Refill Kit for 12\" x 18\" Press","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nfw72e5cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep your existing BestNest Nature Press in working order with this BestNest Nature Press Refill Kit for 12\" x 18\" Press. This package of nine corrugated cardboard sheets and sixteen pieces of blotting papers is specifically designed to fit into your existing BestNest 12\" x 18\" Nature Press (not included), thanks to their inset corners and generous size. They replace the worn elements of your existing press with ease, for you to enjoy using the unit over and over again. Keep your large BestNest Nature Press working well with help from this Nature Press Refill Kit for 12\" x 18\" Press.  Package Contents: 9 sheets corrugated cardboard, 16 blotting papers Dimensions: 17.5\"L x 11.5\"W Construction: cardboard, paper","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nfw72e5cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BestNest","source_asin":"B07FK1ZRTK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336707","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FK1ZRTK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FK1ZRTK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":336708,"name":"Unique Foil Rectangular Plastic Table Cover, 108\" x 54\", Gold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EM5nP2RWL._AC_SL1494_.jpg","description":"Set your table for a delicious party meal with this Foil Gold Plastic Table Cover. Measuring 108 x 54 inches, this table cover will make an excellent choice for any special occasion. Spread it out over your lunch or dinner table to keep it protected from spills and messes when guests sit down to eat. Or use it as a foundation for your appetizer table, drink station, or a table for gifts. Make planning for a big day easy by shopping your party supplies from Unique Industries!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EM5nP2RWL._AC_SL1494_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Unique","source_asin":"B088W2GRWY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336708","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088W2GRWY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088W2GRWY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":336709,"name":"Digital Alarm Clock for Bedrooms, Digital Clock with Modern Curved Design, Conspicuous Blue LED Numbers, 6 Levels Brightness, 2 Volume, 3 Alarm Tones,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Qsg3-yQXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2023 𝐔𝐏𝐆𝐑𝐀𝐃𝐄𝐃 𝐁𝐑𝐈𝐆𝐇𝐓𝐍𝐄𝐒𝐒 -- We have listened to your feedback and have improved the display dimmer with this New Edition. Just spend the same money for a more user-friendly upgraded version with the original 6 Level dimmer but higher brightness. 𝐋𝐀𝐑𝐆𝐄 & 𝐂𝐋𝐄𝐀𝐑 𝐋𝐄𝐃 𝐃𝐈𝐒𝐏𝐋𝐀𝐘 𝐖𝐈𝐓𝐇 6 𝐃𝐈𝐌𝐌𝐄𝐑 -- If you wear glasses, you may want a digital clock with a large display. If you’re sensitive to light, you may look for a bedside clock with a full range of dimming options. This unique alarm clock has it all and meets all your expectations for display. The display is big and bright enough to see the time at any time of the day. 5 Levels brightness+off allows you to adjust the display from very bright to totally invisible. 3 𝐀𝐋𝐀𝐑𝐌 𝐓𝐎𝐍𝐄𝐒 𝐀𝐍𝐃 2 𝐀𝐋𝐀𝐑𝐌 𝐕𝐎𝐋𝐔𝐌𝐄𝐒 -- Different people have different needs on alarming sound and volume, control of sound and volume really matters. Our digital alarm clock for kids has 2 levels of alarm volume adjustment that can be set from 75-85dB. Needless to worry the alarm sound is either too loud thus frightening you or too low to wake you up from deep sleeping. And there are 3 fixed ringing music sounds (Birdsongs, Beep and Chording) you can choose from. 9 𝐌𝐈𝐍𝐔𝐓𝐄𝐒 𝐒𝐍𝐎𝐎𝐙𝐄𝐒 𝐓𝐈𝐌𝐄 -- Uneasy to get up from your bed? The 9 minutes snooze button at the top of the digital alarm clock has a raised horizontal line for quick positioning, easy and simple to operate even if you are half-awake with your eyes half-open. 𝐏𝐥𝐞𝐚𝐬𝐞 𝐧𝐨𝐭𝐞：**𝐓𝐡𝐞𝐫𝐞 𝐢𝐬 𝐚 𝟔:𝟎𝟎 𝐚𝐥𝐚𝐫𝐦 𝐛𝐲 𝐝𝐞𝐟𝐚𝐮𝐥𝐭 𝐰𝐡𝐞𝐧 𝐲𝐨𝐮 𝐟𝐢𝐫𝐬𝐭 𝐩𝐨𝐰𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐝 𝐢𝐭，𝐢𝐟 𝐲𝐨𝐮 𝐝𝐨𝐧'𝐭 𝐧𝐞𝐞𝐝 𝐢𝐭, 𝐩𝐥𝐞𝐚𝐬𝐞 𝐬𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐜𝐡 𝐭𝐨 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐦𝐮𝐭𝐞 𝐤𝐞𝐲 ** 𝐌𝐄𝐌𝐎𝐑𝐘 𝐅𝐔𝐍𝐂𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍 𝐀𝐍𝐃 12/24-𝐇𝐎𝐔𝐑𝐒 -- For this alarm clock for kids, you have the choice between standard time and military time to satisfy your reading time habits. The battery feature works for memorizing the settings in the case of a main power outage. During the battery backup, the screen will go blank and the alarm will not sound, but the clock will display the correct time once power returns. Please note： This clock is powered only by plugging into the USB port. 𝐓𝐇𝐄 𝐔𝐍𝐈𝐐𝐔𝐄 𝐂𝐔𝐑𝐕𝐄𝐃 𝐃𝐄𝐒𝐈𝐆𝐍 𝐌𝐀𝐊𝐄𝐒 𝐈𝐓 𝐀𝐍 𝐈𝐃𝐄𝐀𝐋 𝐆𝐈𝐅𝐓 -- This alarm clock is capable of blending into your interior décor. Designed with versatility in mind, the elegant curve of the clock face, combined with eye-catching blue LED numbers can create a striking appearance, capturing the rhythm of time itself. The stylish bedside clock would be an excellent choice to be a great gift for everyone, and it is suitable for any festival like Fathers Day, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Qsg3-yQXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOLOZA","source_asin":"B0C3LXZG75","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336709","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3LXZG75","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3LXZG75","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
