window.products.push({"id":336725,"name":"LUXU Premium Whiskey Decanter with Glass Stopper,29 oz Bourbon Decanter for Wine | Vodka | Brandy,Iceberg Container Bottle Dispenser with Lid - Alcoho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F69tA6SrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unique Sleek Design – For a Brilliant Barware Display in a classic square silhouette gives you an authentically attractive bar decanter. Perfectly sized for display and too entertain the decanter holds a moderate 29oz. This fashionable whiskey decanter is the ideal way to elevate your drinking experience. Large Capacity – Stylish & Elegant look that adds to any table's aesthetics with their contemporary design.Made of thick and heavy glass, this lovely decanter sparkles in the light, spreading the sunshine. Perfectly safe to use for display, you can sit back, relax, and enjoy your favorite beverage with quality glass decanter. Symmetrica Lines And Aesthetically Pleasing – They are beautifully designed and aesthetically pleasing. The fine lines and curves bring a sophisticated style to both whiskey and wine decanting,How would you like having a Decanter that features a unique design, These amazing decanters are ideal for all of your liquors as well. They feature a shape that enhances your drinks aromas and flavors. Perfect Gift - If you're in the market for a thoughtful and elegant gift, look no further! No matter the occasion - birthdays, holidays, weddings, graduations, anything - these beautifully crafted whiskey decanters are ideal! Perfect for an anniversary, housewarming, Christmas present, Xmas stocking stuffer, kitchen gifts, wedding and engagement gifts, bachelor/bachelorette party and more. Transport Safe - The box is very strong and each glass has a foam bag.Ensure that the parcel arrives safely.Feel absolutely safe in your purchase.If for any reason you’re not satisfied,simply return the glasses for a swift and full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F69tA6SrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUXU","source_asin":"B0BW5QB529","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336725","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BW5QB529","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BW5QB529","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
