window.products.push({"id":336749,"name":"Liquid Courage - Measured Liquor Pourer, Clear Measured Pourer, 3pack, 1.5oz(45ml) Bottle Pourer, Quick Shot, Wine, Cocktail Measure Bottle, Ideal for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81D7OO41FSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH QUALITY PRODUCT : The Liquid Courage liquor pourer is designed to deliver an excellent pouring experience. Our liquor pourer is made from food-grade materials, making it safe for use. Unlike other ordinary pourers, the measuring balls are made from stainless steel that does not rust. You will only receive the best product and performance from Liquid Courage INCREASED ACCURACY : The Liquid Courage liquor pourer features an ergonomic design and offers accuracy control with a perfect, consistent pour speed each and every time you pour a drink. You will experience less spillage and less mess, resulting in increased efficiency and less liquid waste. EASE OF USE : Simply insert the liquor pourer into a bottle, twist slightly, and push until snug. Make sure to prime the liquor pourer by holding a finger or paper towel over the spout and turn the bottle to a 45 degree angle. No extra accessory or equipment required. WIDE APPLICATION : The Liquid Courage Liquor pourer works with a multitude of bottles and bottles sizes. It is ideal for pubs, bars, restaurants, home bars and much more. It will make for a great addition to your bar accessories set. BANG FOR YOUR BUCK : With every purchase made, you will receive 3 measured liquor pourers. They are long-lasting and easy to maintain. You will be able to save some extra coin and unnecessary spillage when you purchase the Liquid Courage measured liquor pourers. PRIMING YOUR LIQUID COURAGE MEASURED LIQUOR POURER STEP 1 : Shake the pourer a few times. STEP 2 : Insert the pourer into your bottle of choice. STEP 3 : Place a finger or paper towel over the spout. STEP 4: Turn the bottle to a 45-degree angle and allow for a full dispense. STEP 5 : Turn the bottle back upright. Drink with Liquid Courage","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81D7OO41FSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Liquid Courage","source_asin":"B08HCYQL5B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336749","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HCYQL5B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HCYQL5B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
