window.products.push({"id":336763,"name":"OYANIMO 8 Pcs Rug Pad Gripper, Reusable Non Slip Carpet Tape, Rug Tape Stickers for Area Rugs, Dual Sided Washable Removable Anti Curl Corner Side Gri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dZTKJKk3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"“----------------- WELCOME TO OUR SHOP -----------------” Package includes: 8 x L-Shaped rug gripper Specifications: Material: PU Color: Black OYANIMO rug pad grippers are a good protector for every home, preventing the elderly, children, and pets from suddenly slipping off the rug while walking and playing. Features: Perfect with all types of floors; Strong adhesion; Easy to install; Easy to cut; Washable and reusable. How to Install: 1. Clean the rug corner & floor surface. 2. Peel off the protective film. 3. Stick firmly to the underside of the rug. 4. Stick the rug to the floor and press it. How to Clean: 1. Wash the rug tape with the carpet together for repeated use. 2. Or wipe out dirt from “on floor” side with a wet tissue. 3. Then air the rug gripper tape, it'll become sticky again. How to Remove It: 1. Pick the grippers up with the rug together from the floor 2. Moisten the rug grippers before you remove the tapes from the mat 3. Pull very slowly so that your carpet and floor would not be damaged NOTE: 1. It is not recommended to use the area rug with FLUFF backing, as the rug gripper is very sticky and may remove the fluff. 2. It is not recommended to use the area rug with JUTE or RUBBER backing, as the rug gripper may not stick to these materials. 3. If you are not sure whether the rug gripper work for your rugs or floors, please cut a small part to try first. SERVICE GUARANTEE Customer satisfaction is one of our top priorities, if you have any problems with our items or services, please feel free to contact us-100% satisfaction guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dZTKJKk3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OYANIMO","source_asin":"B0BLYWH8D4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336763","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLYWH8D4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLYWH8D4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
