window.products.push({"id":336830,"name":"InnoBeta Nurse Blanket, Warm Soft Fuzzy Blanket for Women, Nurse Gift for Female Nurse, RN, Retired Nurse on National Nurse Day, Nursing School Gradua","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sn8zyn3qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Incredible & Unique Nurse Gift: Can you imagine the stress and tiredness a nurse is going through every day in and day out? Especially for those who work on the front lines. They work a longer shift than ever this year. If someone you care about is a nurse, this blanket is a beautiful and practical gift that delivers a warm and positive message-[Not all angels have wings, some have stethoscopes]. Perfect Cuddle or Snuggle Choice: You may not be able to hug her during shifts but this blanket can! A perfect blanket for any working or retired nurses like a registered nurse, RN, licensed practical nurse, LVN, LPN, APRN, healthcare workers, ER, on National Nurses Day, Nursing school graduation, Thanksgiving, Christmas, or just because! Premium Quality: Made of 100% fluffy and rich flannel. Lightweight (700g/1.5lb) but warm, breathable & skin-friendly. You can take this blanket/throw anywhere with you. Our blanket is with perfect workmanship. The printing will not fade after washing and is machine washable. A Warm Hug: The Size 50\"x 65\" is perfect for an adult. Extra 5 inch length keeps your toes warm when you are reading or watching TV on a sofa. When you are taking a nap during tiring work, this fluffy blanket can keep you warm and cozy. Lifetime Warranty: We are committed to providing customers with the highest quality products and impeccable customer service. If for any reason you are not fully satisfied with your purchase, please reach out to INNObeta customer care. We’ll happily make things right within 24 working hours!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sn8zyn3qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"InnoBeta","source_asin":"B092LKFVD9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336830","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092LKFVD9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092LKFVD9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":336831,"name":"Hangman L48B L 48-Inch No-Stud Floating Shelf (Black Powder Coat)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":68.51,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dy7UbZwQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Hangman L-48 48 In. No Stud Floating Shelf allows you to easily decorate your home with minimal damage and strong holding power! Hang it in minutes on any drywall, plaster, or paneled wall. Built with the patented HANGMAN Cleat System, this innovative shelf mounts flush against the wall using tiny nails and an aircraft-grade aluminum bracket. Once installed, the No Stud Floating Shelf can hold up to 60 pounds and will not sag! Don’t worry about the studs. Just pick your spot and hang it! This sturdy Black Powder Coated floating wall shelf will leave almost no trace upon removal. A built in-level makes sure your installation will look like you hired a pro. Display kitchen oils, wine bottles, glasses, books, pictures, or whatever you like. All hardware is included—all you need is a hammer!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dy7UbZwQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hangman","source_asin":"B07ZDXKRTH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336831","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZDXKRTH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZDXKRTH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
