window.products.push({"id":336879,"name":"Parve Green Garlic Press – Comfortable Silicone Grip, Fine Chopper – Color Coded Home and Kitchen Accessories by The Kosher Cook","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZcUnBgxyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep your kitchen kosher while using the highest quality kitchen accessories with The Kosher Cook! Nothing adds a burst of flavors to meals like garlic and with our amazing garlic press tool, you’ll be easily be peeling and crushing some garlic for dinner time to add a little zest to your dish. Stylish design and compact construction makes it a must-have in any kitchen or cooking setting! PRODUCT FEATURES Easy to Use Manual Garlic Press  Comfortable Handle Grip  Perfect for Squeezing Small Vegetables and Herbs Into Fine Pieces Easy to Clean Color Separated for Kosher Household: - Blue for Dairy (Milchik)- Red for Meat (Fleishik)- Green For Parve With just a squeeze of your new tool, you’ll be one step closer to that delicious meal you’ve been waiting to enjoy all day. Our garlic press is convenient, cool, and compact and makes for the perfect accessory to have in any kitchen. User-friendly design so anyone can use! Comfortable grip makes sure you never strain your hands or fingers while using it. KEEPING IT KOSHER The Kosher Cook provides a wide array of tools to help separate milchig, fleishig and parev. Color coded products and tools along with labels and stickers allow you to see at a glance if the item is dairy, meat or pareve. Whether you are new to keeping kashrut or a seasoned veteran looking to make life easier, the Kosher Cook has the tools to keep the highest standards of kosher cooking. About The Kosher Cook Part of the Ner Mitzvah family, The Kosher Cook is another way we to help you keep Jewish traditions and laws. Family-operated since the 1940’s, Ner Mitzvah is an expert maker of household products and the premier source for traditional and gift Judaica items.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZcUnBgxyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Kosher Cook","source_asin":"B07P6DNJ2J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336879","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P6DNJ2J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P6DNJ2J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
