window.products.push({"id":336895,"name":"3 PCS Air Fryer Silicone Liners, 7.9 Inch Silicone Air Fryer Basket with Heat Proof Gloves, Replacement of Parchment Paper Liners for 4 to 7 QT, Reusa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71if8mShfCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【REUSABLE & SAFE MATERIAL】Contains 3 packs of reusable air Fried silicone pot liners that won't deform or break after hundreds of uses and are the most valuable air fryer accessories. Made of food grade silicone, non-toxic and non-stick. More durable, affordable and safe than disposable parchment paper, no burning hazard! You get an environmentally friendly and safe alternative. 【EASY TO CLEAN】Our air-fried silicon liners is easy to clean, you just need to wash it with water, and it's dishwasher safe. You can totally stop worrying about clean air fryer baskets. Keep your air fryer free of food debris, grease and dirt. Completely dishwasher-safe, allowing you to avoid the hassle of hand washing! Make you more willing to use the air fryer and enjoy cooking more. 【HEAT RESISTANT & HEAT RESISTANT GLOVES】Reusable air fryer liners made from BPA-Free food-grade silicone. Non stick, non fade, durable thick material, non burning, heat resistant to 446℉(230℃). We also include a pair of heat resistant gloves for you to protect your hands from burns when taking them out. 【UNIQUE DESIGN】The air fryer silicone mat has a foldable design that reduces the size for easy storage while also raising the edges to prevent grease spatter. Unique 3D drainage tank to realize the separation of filter oil and juice without sticking to the food, improve the heat circulation, make the food fully heated, more uniform. So you can enjoy better taste, healthier food. 【WIDE APPLICATION】This silicone Air Fryer liner is suitable for air fryers, microwaves, ovens, pans, steamers, skillet, toaster, fruit trays, etc. Ideal for home baking, camping, summer parties, etc., it is a very practical kitchen tool. DO IT WITH CAUTION: Do not place silicone liners in the air fryer silicone liners during the preheating process, as the heating element may produce smoke.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71if8mShfCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FUNNy elf","source_asin":"B0BXD3M9VM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336895","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXD3M9VM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXD3M9VM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":336896,"name":"Well Woven Barclay Sarouk Green Traditional Area Rug 3'11\" Round","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1MJ3zKPd-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Well Woven Barclay Sarouk Green Traditional Area Rug brings together an array of patterns drawn from a carefully selected palette of Modern, European, and Persian Styles. Warm red, green, and blue jewel tones are accented by neutral tones of ivory and beige. The heat set polypropylene fiber gives a 0.4\" pile that is soft, stain resistant, and doesn’t shed or fade over time. The 100% jute backing is safe for wood floors and all four sides of the rug are serged for improved durability. A wide range of shapes, sizes, and designs means this collection has something for rooms of every size and style","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1MJ3zKPd-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Well Woven","source_asin":"B0185SMGNM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336896","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0185SMGNM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0185SMGNM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":336897,"name":"Rescue Me Now Pavilion Gift, Small Tuxedo Cat Vase, 8-1/2-Inch Tall","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vptXfJ2KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy this passionately designed functional vase of your favorite cat. From the Rescue Me Now line of Pavilion Gift, this line incorporates items from actual rescued dogs and cats. In addition to functional and decorative vases, the line also includes teapots, ornaments, mugs, spoon rests, salt and pepper shakers and unique ear plates. Each artisan quality vase was designed from photos of real-life beloved pets. A portion of the proceeds from the sale of every item in Rescue Me Now is donated to the WSPA, World Society for the Protection of Animals, in efforts to help the fight against animal cruelty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vptXfJ2KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pavilion Gift Company","source_asin":"B0054YOD14","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336897","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0054YOD14","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0054YOD14","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":336898,"name":"Bodum Chef 9-Piece Stainless-Steel Cutlery Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41RAFDQ14TL._AC_.jpg","description":"There is nothing more indispensable--even among your most important kitchen tools--than good knives. They are the unmistakable sign of a good chef at work, as only the right sharp knives make for excellent results and are fun to chop, cut, and garnish with. When the Bodum design team studied chefs both in the home and in professional kitchens, we observed that a lot of them actually hold their knives partially along the top of the blade instead of strictly on the handle. We also observed that the common knife can't accommodate different ways of holding it. Our solution: a bolster between the blade and the handle for more comfort and a more accurate grip. This comfortably thick bolster with its concave oval top is a perfect resting place for either forefinger or thumb, depending on the chef's preference and task at hand. The bolster is designed at an angle toward the handle so that the pressure point straight underneath it is actually the end of the blade. This makes for enhanced transmission of energy and a very comfortable working experience. Bodum Chef line knives are handmade of the finest Japanese blade steel--molybdenum/vanadium stainless steel--and are hardened to a Rockwell hardness of 57. The handle is cast in 18/8 stainless chrome steel and has a special die-cast texture for a nonslip grip. Bodum Chef knives should be sharpened regularly and should never be placed in the dishwasher or left in a sink with water. For best results clean them with a damp towel and wipe dry. The nine-piece professional-grade chef's knife set features a 10-inch chef's knife, 9-inch bread knife, 7-inch santoku Japanese chef's knife, 6-inch boning knife, 5-inch tomato knife, 5-inch well-rounded utility knife, and 6-inch all-purpose knife as well as a powerful, space-saving magnet for hanging your knives.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41RAFDQ14TL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bodum","source_asin":"B000HPQXS6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336898","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000HPQXS6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000HPQXS6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
