window.products.push({"id":336980,"name":"BINO | Plastic Storage Bins, Shallow Medium | THE HANDLER COLLECTION | Multipurpose Organizer Bins | Kitchen Pantry Organizers and Storage | Clear Con","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wird+aNjS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multipurpose Storage: Expertly designed to keep your pantry shelves neatly organized. Our clear organizer bins are great for home or office use for custom organization. Also, for craft supplies, use for the laundry room and bathroom, and even to streamline your fridge too. Expand your possibilities with our versatile clear organizer. Smart Storage Design: Our modern and minimalist fridge organizer is a convenient way to organize and group your pantry or any space. Its portable design makes it easy to lift, slide, and transport from shelf to shelf. A clean, clear, and simple design makes our organizer bins suitable for use in the pantry, fridge, or on any shelf. Store your food in style! Sturdy Plastic Construction: Our organizing storage bins are made of shatter-resistant plastic and are BPA-free, making them particularly durable and family-friendly. It is ideal for storing food in the refrigerator with our clear containers that are food-safe and with their easy-to-clean design, keeping them clean is a breeze with mild soap and water. Visible and Accessible: Our organizer bins are ideal for storing anything in your refrigerator, pantry, or elsewhere in your home. The see-through design allows you to easily identify what's inside without digging through the bin, making it ideal for small pantries and fridges. Conveniently store and organize food, medicine, bottles, and other items here. Convenient Size: Our clear storage bins come in 9 different sizes. This shallow, medium bin measures approximately 12\" L x 6\" W x 4\" H and is ideal for storing various objects. Whether you use them as kitchen and fridge organizers, cabinet and drawer storage, pantry shelf bins, toy containers, or bathroom organizers, they won't take up too much space and will assist you in keeping areas clutter-free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wird+aNjS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BINO","source_asin":"B082VKW721","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-336980","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082VKW721","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082VKW721","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
